# Line endings are LF in every working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows converts to CRLF and `gofmt -l .` reports
# every file in the repository as unformatted - which is what happened, and
# which no amount of checking on a Linux or macOS machine would have shown.
# Go source is LF by convention, and the tooling assumes it.
* text=auto eol=lf
